    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Description</strong>: Fight your way through each level to wake from this Nightmare or remain trapped in the dream. Can you escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong>: In Simple Nightmares: Strategic Shooter, expect the unexpected. Each meticulously crafted scene ensures unpredictable and exhilarating enemy encounters. Light puzzle elements enhance interaction with the environment.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538420/extras/66bcce3fe31e2d6acd9ce0f384e9c110.poster.avif?t=1745195213\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538420/extras/66bcce3fe31e2d6acd9ce0f384e9c110.webm?t=1745195213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538420/extras/66bcce3fe31e2d6acd9ce0f384e9c110.mp4?t=1745195213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere and Challenge</strong>: I strive to build a suspenseful and unpredictable atmosphere, drawing from popular science fiction to create enemies that stealthily approach players, catching them off guard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>: Simple controls, best suited for keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic environments with randomized elements that keep gameplay fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspenseful atmosphere blended with action.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Description</strong>: Fight your way through each level to wake from this Nightmare or remain trapped in the dream. Can you escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong>: In Simple Nightmares: Strategic Shooter, expect the unexpected. Each meticulously crafted scene ensures unpredictable and exhilarating enemy encounters. Light puzzle elements enhance interaction with the environment.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538420/extras/66bcce3fe31e2d6acd9ce0f384e9c110.poster.avif?t=1745195213\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538420/extras/66bcce3fe31e2d6acd9ce0f384e9c110.webm?t=1745195213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538420/extras/66bcce3fe31e2d6acd9ce0f384e9c110.mp4?t=1745195213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere and Challenge</strong>: I strive to build a suspenseful and unpredictable atmosphere, drawing from popular science fiction to create enemies that stealthily approach players, catching them off guard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>: Simple controls, best suited for keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic environments with randomized elements that keep gameplay fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspenseful atmosphere blended with action.</p>",
